OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to target town's empty
OL,4,Ahomes and hotels
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlackpool Council is drawing plans up
OL,7,Fto reduce the number of empty and
OL,8,Fderelict houses and hotels in the
OL,9,Fseaside town.
OL,11,FOfficial data show there were about
OL,12,F1,500 empty homes in the resort last
OL,13,Fyear, among the highest number for any
OL,14,Ftown in the United Kingdom.
OL,16,FUnoccupied shops, long-term empty B&Bs
OL,17,Fand deteriorating, disused hotels
OL,18,Fcreate a number of serious issues for
OL,19,FBlackpool, while the council is also
OL,20,Fworried about the number of empty
OL,21,Fhouses.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
