OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to target town's empty
OL,4,Ahomes and hotels
OL,5,
OL,6,FApart from the negative visual
OL,7,Fimpression, it believes empty houses
OL,8,Fare a vandalism magnet, raise health
OL,9,Fand safety concerns, exacerbate the
OL,10,Fserious shortage of affordable homes in
OL,11,Fthe town and mean a reduction in
OL,12,Fcouncil tax and business rate revenue.
